    "detailed_description": "In this prequel to Swamp Castle and the Great Tournament, lead a medieval faction as it attempts to secure the Kingdom of Magincia. Deal with other hostile factions and fight off barbarians to secure your rule.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>       Use diplomacy, war, or intrigue to defeat your rival factions<br></li><li>       Randomly generated events and stats result in new game each time you play.<br></li><li>       Work for the betterment of the Kingdom and people, or take all its riches for yourself.<br></li><li>       Send diplomats to rival factions to sue for peace or spies to cause chaos and war among your rivals.<br></li><li>       Train your army with a variety of unit troops. Upgrade their equipment and training.<br></li><li>       Choose your general and level him/her up with a variety of military maneuvers.<br></li><li>       Hire advisors to help in your quest to secure the Kingdom of Magincia.<br></li><li>       Deep story tree results in many different endings.<br></li><li>       Play the game on easy, normal, or hard.<br></li><li>       Unlock achievements and new modes of play. </li></ul>",
